cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Lemmatrix in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Lemmatrix"
abstract: >-
  A program for phonological and grammatical analysis and linguistic
  documentation, for any language: lemmas with their tagged tokens
  (transcriptions, pitch and one recording each), paradigm matrices,
  utterances and texts, stored as readable XML. Human readable, machine
  processable, ethically collected and shared linguistic data.
authors:
